reaction "乙醛银镜反应（净离子氧化还原式）"
equation "CH₃CHO + H₂O + 2Ag⁺ → CH₃COOH + 2Ag↓ + 2H⁺"
summary "醛基被氧化为羧基，银离子被还原为金属银；实际实验使用氨性硝酸银溶液。"

step "乙醛与银离子" {
  note "实际银镜试剂中Ag⁺以银氨配离子形式存在；这里写出便于追踪电子转移的净离子核心。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O4 O
  atom O5 O
  atom Ag8 Ag charge=+1
  atom Ag9 Ag charge=+1
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H2a H
  atom H5a H
  atom H5b H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O4 2
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond C2 H2a 1
  bond O5 H5a 1
  bond O5 H5b 1
}

step "氧化还原完成" {
  note "乙醛失去电子被氧化，Ag⁺得到电子析出银。考试重点：试管内壁形成银镜；醛基、葡萄糖等还原性物质可呈阳性。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O4 O
  atom O5 O
  atom Ag8 Ag radical
  atom Ag9 Ag radical
  atom H3 H charge=+1
  atom H7 H charge=+1
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H5a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O4 2
  bond C2 O5 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond O5 H5a 1
}
